# DS-8 probe, an IC Housing by an Advanced Furnace: what the furnace
# reports while it smelts. d0: the Advanced Furnace. d1: a Lever.
# r0: RecipeHash. r1: 1 if that is HASH("ItemIronIngot"). r2: Reagents.
# r3: Temperature. r4: Pressure. r5: Combustion. r6: Activate.
# r7: the lever. While it's on, this chip writes Activate 0 every tick,
# as the Fuel Pump chip does once the furnace is hot.
alias Furnace d0
alias Lever d1
main:
yield
bdns Furnace main
l r0 Furnace RecipeHash
seq r1 r0 HASH("ItemIronIngot")
l r2 Furnace Reagents
l r3 Furnace Temperature
l r4 Furnace Pressure
l r5 Furnace Combustion
l r6 Furnace Activate
bdns Lever main
l r7 Lever Open
beqz r7 main
s Furnace Activate 0
j main
